How do you make a legend for nodepies?

>From the vignette:
```
set.seed(2015-12-31)
tr <- rtree(15)
p <- ggtree(tr)

a <- runif(14, 0, 0.33)
b <- runif(14, 0, 0.33)
c <- runif(14, 0, 0.33)
d <- 1 - a - b - c
dat <- data.frame(a=a, b=b, c=c, d=d)
## input data should have a column of `node` that store the node number
dat$node <- 15+1:14

pies <- nodepie(dat, cols=1:4, alpha=.6)
inset(p, pies)
```

 <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png>

I am making several trees with upwards of 10 + labels each so doing it by hand is not feasible. Any ideas appreciated!

